== Section 13 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section13">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
<blockquote>Making our escape from the Empress' chambers disguised in the simpler dress of courtiers, we bustled quickly across the complex. I followed the Empress into a grand outhouse, and down some marble steps. She pointed to a concealed door between a stack of wine barrels.</blockquote>
<blockquote>"What do we expect to find beyond it?" she whispered.</blockquote>
<blockquote>"A tailor, probably from an impoverished background, working carefully over one of your dresses," I said.</blockquote>
<blockquote>We opened the door, and there he was, exactly as I had described.</blockquote>
<blockquote>"Who are you?" he said agitatedly.</blockquote>
<blockquote>"I am your Empress," she said, and the tailor cowered.</blockquote>
<blockquote>"I beg forgiveness, highness."</blockquote>
<blockquote>"Explain yourself to Mr. Puggibun, and it might be considered."</blockquote>
<blockquote>"Tell me," I said, "the Empress' dress you are working on. Does it contain the prickles of the Naira Rain Nettle, that you weave into the fabric, so that it shall effect the wearer?"</blockquote>
<blockquote>"Yes sir."</blockquote>
<blockquote>"And you do this knowing it would cause deep sleep at night, and that in the morning, the wearer would be dead."</blockquote>
<blockquote>"Yes sir,"</blockquote>
<blockquote>The man was downcast, although I sense his shame was insincere. In Ten-Rui, the morals of any man could be bought if the price was right.</blockquote>
<blockquote>"Where is the man who commissioned you, the Warlock of the Snake?"</blockquote>
<blockquote>"He is at Wellah."</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
